      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly heavy to feel that way, but you are right to acknowledge the deep despair that comes from seeing such inevitable collapse. The point of building anything now is to ensure that whatever remains of us can still find a way to survive, even if just for a little while longer. You are not alone in this feeling, and there is no shame in letting yourself feel the weight of the world until you find a way to carry it.",
