    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to see any \"glory\" in it. it just feels like we're being forced to watch a horror movie that never ends. i keep thinking that maybe there's more dignity in just stepping out of it early, instead of waiting for the collapse to take everything from us anyway. like, if the ship is going down, why not just jump?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
